  │                                                                                             │   
  │  Navigation                        Actions                       Tools                      │   
  │  ↑/↓   move (also j/k)             l      launcher menu          s Shell                    │   
  │  enter open / details              *      toggle favorite        S Shell (control plane)    │   
  │  esc/h back                        ctrl+r recent & favorites     9 k9s                      │   
